To check wide quantity order:
  Put "9" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "10" into the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic left operand is not numerically smaller than the arithmetic right operand,
    put "The wide order check failed on different lengths." into the check report; exit.
  If the arithmetic right operand is numerically smaller than the arithmetic left operand,
    put "The wide order check failed on reversed lengths." into the check report; exit.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105726" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic left operand is not numerically smaller than the arithmetic right operand,
    put "The wide order check failed on equal lengths." into the check report; exit.
  If the arithmetic right operand is numerically smaller than the arithmetic right operand,
    put "The wide order check failed on equality." into the check report; exit.

To check wide quantity addition:
  Put "999999999999999999999999999999" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "1" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Add the arithmetic left operand to the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "1000000000000000000000000000000",
    put "The wide addition check failed on a long carry." into the check report; exit.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "1" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Add the arithmetic left operand to the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "170141183460469231731687303715884105728",
    put "The wide addition check failed at the sauce modulus." into the check report; exit.

To check wide quantity subtraction:
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Subtract the arithmetic left operand from the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "0",
    put "The wide subtraction check failed on equality." into the check report; exit.
  Put "999999999999999999999999999999" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "1000000000000000000000000000000" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Subtract the arithmetic left operand from the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "1",
    put "The wide subtraction check failed on a long borrow." into the check report; exit.

