  Put "987654321098765432109876543210" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Multiply the arithmetic left operand by the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "121932631137021795226185032733622923332237463801111263526900",
    put "The wide multiplication check failed." into the check report; exit.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "2" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Multiply the arithmetic left operand by the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "340282366920938463463374607431768211454",
    put "The wide multiplication check failed on the sauce modulus." into the check report; exit.
  Put "0" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "987654321098765432109876543210" into the arithmetic right operand.
  Multiply the arithmetic left operand by the arithmetic right operand.
  If the arithmetic right operand is not "0",
    put "The wide multiplication check failed on zero." into the check report; exit.

To check wide quantity division:
  Put "121932631137021795226185032733622923332237463801111263526900" into the arithmetic left operand.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the arithmetic right operand.
